#: db6eca8e55f8408586db9e8321d6ee47
msgid "Source of truth"
msgstr "权威来源"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/2-workspace_layout.md:10
#: e58afbf7b378438cacd62814664f7e96
msgid ""
"Tree and init flow: [README.EN.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-"
"deploy-ws/blob/main/README.EN.md). The repo root has `init_repo.sh`, "
"`submodules_visibility.conf`, `deb_versions.conf`, and `scripts/` — there"
" is **no** workspace `setup.bash` / env installer besides "
"`./init_repo.sh`."
msgstr ""
"目录树与初始化流程：[README.EN.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws/blob/main/README.EN.md)。仓库根目录有 "
"`init_repo.sh`、`submodules_visibility.conf`、`deb_versions.conf` 和 "
"`scripts/` — 除 `./init_repo.sh` 外**没有**工作区 `setup.bash` / 环境安装脚本。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/2-workspace_layout.md:13
#: eb6b5e78ddc24a6d9cd1d3788c22cbac
msgid ""
"open-deploy-ws/\n"
"├── src/\n"
"│   ├── arms_ros2_control/     # controllers / commands / hardware "
"interfaces / shared libs\n"
"│   ├── robot-descriptions/    # common / manipulator / humanoid (hyphen)"
"\n"
"│   └── ocs2_ros2/             # only if that module is installed as "
"source\n"
"├── init_repo.sh\n"
"├── submodules_visibility.conf\n"
"├── deb_versions.conf\n"
"└── scripts/                   # install_core_debs.sh, "
"uninstall_core_debs.sh"
msgstr ""
"open-deploy-ws/\n"
"├── src/\n"
"│   ├── arms_ros2_control/     # controllers / commands / hardware "
"interfaces / shared libs\n"
"│   ├── robot-descriptions/    # common / manipulator / humanoid (hyphen)"
"\n"
"│   └── ocs2_ros2/             # only if that module is installed as "
"source\n"
"├── init_repo.sh\n"
"├── submodules_visibility.conf\n"
"├── deb_versions.conf\n"
"└── scripts/                   # install_core_debs.sh, "
"uninstall_core_debs.sh"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/2-workspace_layout.md:25
#: b33a39dd676c4ed09792199af879a101
msgid ""
"**Primary path:** `./init_repo.sh` (visibility + per-module `d`/`s`). Do "
"**not** `git submodule update --init --recursive`. After init, `colcon "
"build` (the README does not wrap that). Then `source install/setup.bash` "
"in that workspace — standard ROS 2 overlay, not a FiveAges env script."
msgstr ""
"**主路径：** `./init_repo.sh`（可见性 + 按模块 `d`/`s`）。**不要** `git submodule update"
" --init --recursive`。初始化后 `colcon build`（README 没有封装这一步）。然后在该工作区 `source "
"install/setup.bash` — 这是标准 ROS 2 overlay，不是 FiveAges 环境脚本。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/2-workspace_layout.md:27
#: a2edfdbb5f434069821be290d1dce9d1
msgid ""
"Lean robot branches (`dobot-cr5`, `arx-acone`, plus `arx-lift2s` / "
"`panthera-ht` used in the how-tos) clone only that scheme’s packages. See"
" the same README."
msgstr ""
"精简机器人分支（`dobot-cr5`、`arx-acone`，以及 how-to 中的 `arx-lift2s` / `panthera-"
"ht`）只克隆该方案所需软件包。见同一 README。"

